 },
 "check": {
  "describe": "The host level (76) gives a green icon about three quarters full and \"76%\"; the flow shows 95 (green, nearly full), 40 (amber) and 10 (red, with a red ! in the empty part); the large icon follows the host level. With battery = 15 (the low render) the first and last icons turn red and show the !. The icons keep their size and the three sit in a flow: at 240 dp the 10% one wraps to a second line, at 420 dp everything stays at the start.",
